## 作业 · LC 164 最大间距

**题意。** 找排序后相邻元素的最大差，要求线性时间和线性额外空间；不足2个数返回0。令范围R=max-min，选桶宽 `ceil(R/(n-1))`。最大相邻差至少为该宽，桶内差小于桶宽，因此答案一定来自两个非空桶之间，只需记录每桶最小最大。

| [3,6,9,1]，范围8，桶宽3 | 桶范围 | min/max |
|---|---|---|
| 桶0 | [1,3] | 1/3 |
| 桶1 | [4,6] | 6/6 |
| 桶2 | [7,9] | 9/9 |
| 跨桶 | 6-3=3，9-6=3 | 答案3 |

<a id="tpl-bucket-extrema"></a>

**区间桶：只存最小值与最大值**

对 [3,6,9,1] 取桶宽 3。每桶保留极值，一次扫描求本桶最小值与上个非空桶最大值之差。

```python
def maximum_gap(values):
    if len(values) < 2 or max(values) == min(values):
        return 0
    low, high = min(values), max(values)
    span = high - low
    width = (span + len(values) - 2) // (len(values) - 1)
    count = span // width + 1
    minima, maxima = [None] * count, [None] * count
    for value in values:
        i = (value - low) // width
        if minima[i] is None:
            minima[i] = maxima[i] = value
        else:
            minima[i] = min(minima[i], value)
            maxima[i] = max(maxima[i], value)
    previous, best = low, 0
    for smallest, largest in zip(minima, maxima):
        if smallest is not None:
            best = max(best, smallest - previous)
            previous = largest
    return best


print(maximum_gap([3, 6, 9, 1]))
```

```java
import java.util.*;
class Solution {
    public int maximumGap(int[] nums) {
        if (nums.length < 2) return 0;
        int min = nums[0], max = nums[0];
        for (int x : nums) { min = Math.min(min, x); max = Math.max(max, x); }
        if (min == max) return 0;
        long range = (long) max - min;
        long width = (range + nums.length - 2) / (nums.length - 1);
        int buckets = (int) (range / width) + 1;
        int[] low = new int[buckets], high = new int[buckets];
        boolean[] used = new boolean[buckets];
        Arrays.fill(low, Integer.MAX_VALUE);
        Arrays.fill(high, Integer.MIN_VALUE);
        for (int x : nums) {
            int index = (int) (((long) x - min) / width);
            used[index] = true;
            low[index] = Math.min(low[index], x);
            high[index] = Math.max(high[index], x);
        }
        long best = 0;
        int previous = min;
        for (int i = 0; i < buckets; i++) if (used[i]) {
            best = Math.max(best, (long) low[i] - previous);
            previous = high[i];
        }
        return (int) best;
    }
}

class Demo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(new Solution().maximumGap(new int[] {3, 6, 9, 1}));
    }
}
```

两边返回 3。Python 的 None 哨兵区分空桶和数值恰为 0 的桶，两列列表同长，zip 逐桶配对读取。在桶内保存两个极值即可，内存与桶数成正比。 Java 的示例入口是 `Demo.main`。

`(a+b-1)/b` 对非负a、正b实现向上取整；long 防止范围计算溢出。used 区分空桶，不能把空桶哨兵参与答案。原题非负数且范围使答案可用int；扩展到完整有符号整数范围应返回long。时间 O(n)，空间 O(n)。测试全相等、两个数、空桶很长、重复最小最大值。

