| 检查 | 下标1不是2 | 答案2 |

<a id="tpl-cyclic-placement"></a>

**把下标当作桶：将正整数原地归位**

给定 [3,4,-1,1]，值 x 属于下标 x−1。每轮重新读取交换回来的值，直到它不在范围内、已经归位或与目标位重复。

```python
def first_missing(nums):
    for i in range(len(nums)):
        while 1 <= nums[i] <= len(nums):
            target = nums[i] - 1
            if nums[target] == nums[i]:
                break
            nums[target], nums[i] = nums[i], nums[target]
    for i, value in enumerate(nums):
        if value != i + 1:
            return i + 1
    return len(nums) + 1


print(first_missing([3, 4, -1, 1]))
